\n                        <b>Image with Description</b></h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"><b>\n                        P</b>rogress with evidence of continuous fruitful activities and steady involvement of South Sudanese citizens ready for development, adaptation to change, and open for opportunities and awareness of risks is at the moment being witnessed. However, despite the expected growth, uncertainties to provide opportunities to some disadvantaged people who experienced most unspeakable poverty, turmoil, and violence during the war and civil unrest in South Sudan remained unrealized. This group include children denied education, die from treatable and preventable diseases, forced into child labor, and married off as soon as they reach puberty, and gender-based violence.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>","_cid":"tsoZzCCgs6","_anchor":"image1-2f","_protectedParams":[],"_global":false,"_once":false,"_params":{}},{"alias":false,"_styles":{"padding-top":"(@paddingTop * 1rem)","padding-bottom":"(@paddingBottom * 1rem)","background-color":"@bgColor",".line":{"background-color":"@lineColor","align":"center","height":"2px","margin":"0 auto"},".mbr-text":{"color":"#000000"}},"_name":"content6","_sourceTheme":"mobirise5","_customHTML":"<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content6\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        \n        <input type=